### Test showPublic filter functionality

### 1. GET members as public (unauthenticated) - should only return members with showPublic=true
GET http://localhost:3000/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. GET members as admin (authenticated) - should return all members
GET http://localhost:3000/api/members
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: auth_token=YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 3. Test homepage - should only show public members
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: text/html

### 4. Toggle member visibility (requires admin auth)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/members/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: auth_token=YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "showPublic": false
}

### 5. Toggle back to public
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/members/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: auth_token=YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "showPublic": true
}

### 6. Verify single member endpoint includes showPublic field
GET http://localhost:3000/api/members/1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: auth_token=YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
